#: ../../source/advanced/customize-model.md:1 8c1a30d4940f436bb24e0c56dc103b26
msgid "自定义模型"
msgstr "Custom models"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-model.md:3 b9e5326444174f8d9d60dcb1413f82cb
msgid ""
"在 UniKT 中添加自定义知识追踪模型，遵循\"定义 → 注册 → 配置\"三步法。本文以真实模型 GIKT（Yang et al., "
"ECML-PKDD 2020）的实现为例展开。"
msgstr ""
"To add a custom knowledge tracing model in UniKT, follow the three-step approa"
"ch: \"define → register → configure\". This guide uses the real-world model GI"
"KT (Yang et al., ECML-PKDD 2020) as a running example."

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-model.md:5 76bfb76786384306ba712e4184126e35
msgid "概述"
msgstr "Overview"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-model.md:14 33c901c52eb542c296ba4ead5d700f07
msgid "UniKT 的模型系统由三个核心文件组成，以 GIKT 为例："
msgstr "UniKT's model system consists of three core files. Taking GIKT as an example:"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-model.md:23 a3610c986c4e41829b036ac5cdc71cd7
msgid "第一步：定义模型"
msgstr "Step 1: Define the model"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-model.md:25 a4e8dfaf0f50457a91b7b2933123bfa2
msgid ""
"模型是一个标准的 ``torch.nn.Module`` 子类。需要实现 ``forward`` 方法，接收训练器传入的 batch "
"数据，返回预测 logits。"
msgstr ""
"The model is a standard ``torch.nn.Module`` subclass. You must implement the `"
"`forward`` method, which receives batch data from the trainer and returns pred"
"iction logits."

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-model.md:66 ece120ab37a9483296d373451c4ea6fb
msgid "**关键约定**："
msgstr "**Key conventions:**"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-model.md:68 35bbf7b5df8f4da3b619d7ad630d0b61
msgid ""
"构造函数接收 ``args``（命令行参数 Namespace）和 ``data_metadata``（数据集元信息 dict，包含 "
"``num_skills``、``num_questions`` 等）。"
msgstr ""
"The constructor receives ``args`` (a CLI argument Namespace) and ``data_metada"
"ta`` (a dataset metadata dict, containing ``num_skills``, ``num_questions``, e"
"tc.)."

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-model.md:69 0e962f7abc0e4be9bbc66c2296380037
msgid "``forward`` 输出形状为 ``[B, S-1]``（next-item 预测：t 时刻预测 t+1 时刻的正确性）。"
msgstr ""
"``forward`` output shape must be ``[B, S-1]`` (next-item prediction: at time t"
", predict correctness at time t+1)."

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-model.md:70 41d7d2755f054e478a7bf4c63e06eb69
msgid "可使用 ``kwargs`` 接收训练器额外传入的数据（如图数据、邻居索引等）。"
msgstr ""
"Use ``kwargs`` to receive additional data from the trainer (e.g., graph data, "
"neighbor indices)."

